      "text": "I built kern because I needed a fast, zero-daemon tool to set CPU&#x2F;RAM limits and run isolated tasks without the overhead of Docker. It&#x27;s a single 1.5MB Rust binary using OCI images, cgroup v2, and namespaces. Boxes start in ~3.5ms. It&#x27;s not a Kubernetes CRI or a microVM, just a standalone container and resource runtime for CLI and agents.",
